          "organization_c3bebbb90f574e4d"
        ],
        "date": "1996-04-24",
        "text": "Eight months later, my father went to work somewhere new. My father went to work somewhere new. My father went to work somewhere new. My father Leon works as a truck driver at Massey Trucking."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-started:first"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:2",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:1",
          "organization_a37d09070eae8e1e"
        ],
        "date": "2012-09-26",
        "text": "Sixteen years on, I started working for Rosa Manufacturing. The pay was about $15 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:1",
          "organization_a37d09070eae8e1e",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:2",
          "organization_ab4d5bac7d19376c"
        ],
        "date": "2014-05-22",
        "text": "A year and a half on, after Rosa Manufacturing, I took a job at Vasquez Supply Company. I had worked at Rosa Manufacturing for a year and a half. It paid about $20 an hour, up from about $15."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:1",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:2",
          "organization_ab4d5bac7d19376c",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:3",
          "organization_5ffa625326936e1e"
        ],
        "date": "2016-08-16",
        "text": "Two years later, I left Vasquez Supply Company for a job at Summers Construction. I had been there two years. It paid about $15 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:2",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:3",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:4",
          "organization_44355bce5e6be4af",
          "organization_5ffa625326936e1e"
        ],
        "date": "2018-02-19",
        "text": "A year and a half on, I left for a job at Carlson's Kitchen. I had worked at Summers Construction for a year and a half. It paid about $15 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:3",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:4",
          "organization_44355bce5e6be4af",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:5",
          "organization_8d28764d67b126fb"
        ],
        "date": "2019-07-06",
        "text": "A year and a half later, I went from Carlson's Kitchen to Lloyd's Market. I had been there a year and a half. It paid about $10 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:4",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:5",
          "organization_8d28764d67b126fb",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:6",
          "organization_c3bebbb90f574e4d"
        ],
        "date": "2020-12-02",
        "text": "A year and a half on, after Lloyd's Market, I took a job at Massey Trucking. I had worked at Lloyd's Market for a year and a half. It paid about $20 an hour, up from about $10."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:5",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:6",
          "organization_c3bebbb90f574e4d",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:7",
          "organization_a37d0a070eae8fd1"
        ],
        "date": "2023-01-16",
        "text": "Two years later, I left Massey Trucking for a job at Nguyen Manufacturing. I had been there two years. It paid about $20 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:6",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:7",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:8",
          "organization_9c23d9190ca580d7",
          "organization_a37d0a070eae8fd1"
        ],
        "date": "2024-10-24",
        "text": "Two years on, I left for a job at Santiago Building Services. I had worked at Nguyen Manufacturing for two years. It paid about $20 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e22c91f8663c",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:let-go"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:7",
          "past-work:person_00e7e22c91f8663c:8",
          "organization_9c23d9190ca580d7"
        ],
        "date": "2024-11-18",
        "text": "One month on, Santiago Building Services let me go. It was tough. I had worked there one month. It had paid about $20 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["household:sibling-older", "household:siblings-born"],
        "recordIds": [
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef:family:person_dd97e4374edda5f9",
          "person_dd97e4374edda5f9",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef:family:person_dd97e7374eddab12",
          "person_dd97e7374eddab12",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef:family:person_dd97e8374eddacc5",
          "person_dd97e8374eddacc5",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef:family:person_dd97e5374edda7ac",
          "person_dd97e5374edda7ac",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef:family:person_dd97e6374edda95f",
          "person_dd97e6374edda95f"
        ],
        "date": "1960-10-08",
        "text": "My brother Jeffrey was born before me. My sister Suzanne, my sister Julie, my sister Rebecca and my brother Daniel were born after me."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["household:school-started:elementary"],
        "recordIds": [
          "school.started:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:1966",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
          "organization:public-schools:jurisdiction_d99d12423c39ea05"
        ],
        "date": "1966-08-29",
        "text": "When I was 5 years old, I started school at Columbia Furnace Public Schools."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["job-started:first"],
        "recordIds": [
          "school.started:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:1966",
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:pre:1",
          "organization_a37d09070eae8e1e"
        ],
        "date": "1981-10-08",
        "text": "Fifteen years on, I was hired by Rosa Manufacturing. The pay was about $25 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["family:child"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:pre:1",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef:family:person_b980433d662f65c7",
          "person_b980433d662f65c7"
        ],
        "date": "1987-03-25",
        "text": "Five years later, my son Stephen was born. I was 26 then. Stephen was my first child. I'll never forget that."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:pre:2",
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:1",
          "organization_a37d09070eae8e1e"
        ],
        "date": "1989-10-08",
        "text": "Three years later, I left for a job at Rosa Manufacturing. I had been there four years. It paid about $25 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["family:child"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:pre:2",
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
          "kinship_134facd3d1322f6a:past:person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
          "person_00e7e22c91f8663c"
        ],
        "date": "1990-06-21",
        "text": "Nine months later, my daughter Christine was born. I was 29 then."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:1",
          "organization_a37d09070eae8e1e",
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:2",
          "organization_a37d0a070eae8fd1"
        ],
        "date": "1996-04-24",
        "text": "Six years later, I left Rosa Manufacturing for a job at Nguyen Manufacturing. I had been there seven years. It paid about $25 an hour."
      },
      {
        "person": "person_00e7e32c91f867ef",
        "kinds": ["job-ended:moved-on"],
        "recordIds": [
          "past-work:person_00e7e32c91f867ef:1",
